==English==

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|sea|shore}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{enPR|sēʹshô}}, {{IPA|/ˈsiːʃɔː/|lang=en}}
* {{a|GenAm}} {{enPR|sēʹshôr}}, {{IPA|/ˈsiːʃɔɹ/|lang=en}}
