* {{sense|strip between high and low water marks}} {{l|en|foreshore}}, {{l|en|intertidal zone}}, {{l|en|littoral}}

====Hypernyms====
* {{sense|land bordering the sea}} {{l|en|shore}}, {{l|en|coast}}, {{l|en|strand}}

